{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":22,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":22,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67625f4429d1fd72f77d0","chatId":"48128fda0fe4434ea497e68cb61f71b9","sessionId":null,"userId":99850,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"你说到“有点开心”，我留意到后面跟着一句“觉得没用就没弄了”。好像一件让你开心的事，得先证明有用才配继续。这个标准，听着有点像你爸妈那句“要争气”。当时停下来，是你自己觉得没意义，还是别的什么原因？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"你说到“有点开心”，我留意到后面跟着一句“觉得没用就没弄了”。好像一件让你开心的事，得先证明有用才配继续。这个标准，听着有点像你爸妈那句“要争气”。当时停下来，是你自己觉得没意义，还是别的什么原因？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2426,"promptTokens":2543,"completionTokens":151,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:57"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":23,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909691649709429,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67625f4429d1fd72f77cf","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536997257,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:57","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af67625f4429d1fd72f77cf","chatId":"48128fda0fe4434ea497e68cb61f71b9","sessionId":null,"userId":99850,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"我想想……大学那会儿自己捣鼓过一个小项目，纯粹觉得好玩。不过后来觉得没用，就没弄了。说起来，好像那时候是有点开心的。<第11轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":22,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005909691649709429,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af67625f4429d1fd72f77d0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536997254,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:57","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6761ef4429d1fd72f77be","chatId":"48128fda0fe4434ea497e68cb61f71b9","sessionId":null,"userId":99850,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"“一直在按他们想的那样走，走着走着就不知道哪些是自己想的”——这句话挺重的。好像你走了很远，回头才发现路是别人画的。那在这些年里，有没有哪件事，是你自己真心想做的？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"“一直在按他们想的那样走，走着走着就不知道哪些是自己想的”——这句话挺重的。好像你走了很远，回头才发现路是别人画的。那在这些年里，有没有哪件事，是你自己真心想做的？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1864,"promptTokens":3068,"completionTokens":86,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:50"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":21,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.010984437004026437,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6761ef4429d1fd72f77bd","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536990651,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:50","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6761ef4429d1fd72f77bd","chatId":"48128fda0fe4434ea497e68cb61f71b9","sessionId":null,"userId":99850,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"从小吧……他们也没逼我，就是总说“你要争气”。我好像一直在按他们想的那样走，可走着走着，就不知道哪些是我自己想的了。<第10轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.010984437004026437,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":5,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":5,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":1,"sort":4},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5}],"relationId":"6af6761ef4429d1fd72f77be","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536990648,"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:50","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6761af4429d1fd72f77b3","chatId":"48128fda0fe4434ea497e68cb61f71b9","sessionId":null,"userId":99850,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"听到你说“是不是挺失败的”，我心里有点沉。你把自己的不顺，慢慢变成了对自己的否定，好像达不到爸妈期待的样子，就是你的错。可这种“失败感”更像是一种压力，不是事实。你觉得爸妈那份期待，是从什么时候开始压在你身上的？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"听到你说“是不是挺失败的”，我心里有点沉。你把自己的不顺，慢慢变成了对自己的否定，好像达不到爸妈期待的样子，就是你的错。可这种“失败感”更像是一种压力，不是事实。你觉得爸妈那份期待，是从什么时候开始压在你身上的？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1883,"promptTokens":2407,"completionTokens":112,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 10:29:46"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":19,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.020327149270537397,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6761af4429d1fd72f77b2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794536986196,"createTime":"